  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Development Carbon Fund (CDCF) Technical Assistance Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;TO ENHANCE CDCF CAPCAITY BUILDING 1)Building the capacity of local private and public sectors to facilitate and regulate carbon finance flows and develop specific projects, thus facilitating the generation of greenhouse gas emission reduction, improving the quality of life of local communities, and strengthening poverty alleviation effort by the international community.
 Strengthening the role of local intermediaries in bundling and financing small-scale projects eligible for carbon finance, and in identifying portfolios of eligible projects for support by the CDCF Trust Fund (as indicated in para. 49 in the CDCF Board Papers entitled .A Proposal to Establish the Community Development Carbon Fund., March 11, 2003).&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
